WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.370 --> 01:34.900
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.280 --> 01:37.850
[Episode 16]

4
01:39.100 --> 01:42.080
[Guiyang, Guizhou]

5
01:39.229 --> 01:42.039
One minute he says our Guizhou Army is useless,

6
01:42.310 --> 01:45.910
and the next he says mobilizing the Sichuan Army, Hunan Army, and Yunnan Army

7
01:45.910 --> 01:46.910
will take time.

8
01:46.850 --> 01:49.330
[Wang Jialie, Commander of the Kuomintang's 25th Army and Chairman of Guizhou Provincial Government]

9
01:47.120 --> 01:48.479
But he just won't tell me

10
01:48.789 --> 01:51.390
whether the Central Army will cross the river.

11
01:52.750 --> 01:56.360
[Wan Shufen, Wang Jialie's Wife]

12
01:55.440 --> 01:56.680
He's new here.

13
01:57.170 --> 01:58.420
He has no idea yet.

14
01:59.150 --> 02:00.430
During his trip to Fenghua,

15
02:00.430 --> 02:01.790
Chiang gave him orders.

16
02:02.280 --> 02:04.480
He definitely won't hesitate anymore.

17
02:04.560 --> 02:07.720
Does Chiang need to give orders in person?

18
02:11.560 --> 02:12.820
I simply can't believe

19
02:13.150 --> 02:15.710
Chiang would just let Zunyi

20
02:15.710 --> 02:17.400
and the whole Qianbei be occupied by the Communist army

21
02:17.400 --> 02:19.260
without doing anything about it!

22
02:21.060 --> 02:24.829
Right now, I really hope the Communist army in Zunyi

23
02:25.530 --> 02:27.280
are only passing through.

24
02:27.930 --> 02:29.860
The sooner they leave, the better.

25
02:31.050 --> 02:32.810
May the Bodhisattva bless us.

26
02:42.360 --> 02:43.420
Where are you going?

27
02:43.420 --> 02:46.079
I'm going to Hongfu Temple to burn some incense.

28
02:48.329 --> 02:50.350
Going to Hongfu Temple to burn some incense?

29
02:50.350 --> 02:51.550
Will that do any good?

30
02:57.110 --> 03:03.580
[Fenghua, Zhejiang]

31
02:58.020 --> 02:59.520
Following your instructions,

32
02:59.520 --> 03:01.870
I have ordered Guo Siyan's 99th Division

33
03:01.960 --> 03:03.830
to take over the defense of Guiyang.

34
03:03.830 --> 03:04.680
At the same time,

35
03:04.680 --> 03:06.190
I have also sent a few trusted men

36
03:06.190 --> 03:08.280
[Chiang Kai-shek, Generalissimo of the Military Affairs of the Commission of Kuomintang]

37
03:06.230 --> 03:08.090
to conduct a covert investigation.

38
03:08.090 --> 03:09.670
Have you found something?

39
03:08.410 --> 03:11.350
[Xue Yue, Frontline Commander of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army and Commander of the 1st Army Group]

40
03:10.870 --> 03:12.190
Our investigation shows that

41
03:12.190 --> 03:13.720
over the years, Wang Jialie

42
03:13.750 --> 03:15.520
has indeed planned a series of

43
03:15.540 --> 03:17.630
moves against the central government.

44
03:17.630 --> 03:21.210
Such as the mutual-defense pact among Guangdong, Guangxi, and Guizhou,

45
03:21.210 --> 03:23.120
the mutual-defense pact between Guizhou and Hunan,

46
03:23.120 --> 03:24.880
and the pact between Guizhou and Yunnan.

47
03:24.880 --> 03:26.480
Is there any solid evidence?

48
03:26.800 --> 03:28.840
We are still gathering evidence.

49
03:29.120 --> 03:30.310
Once the evidence has been compiled,

50
03:30.310 --> 03:31.630
we'll submit it to you at once.

51
03:31.630 --> 03:32.520
Good.

52
03:33.210 --> 03:35.450
Also, according to my covert investigation,

53
03:35.450 --> 03:37.360
Wang Jialie's 25th Army

54
03:37.630 --> 03:39.400
is full of internal conflicts.

55
03:39.490 --> 03:41.000
Several of his top commanders,

56
03:41.000 --> 03:42.530
including He Zhizhong

57
03:43.860 --> 03:44.860
and Bai Huizhang,

58
03:45.079 --> 03:46.860
appear loyal to him on the surface,

59
03:46.860 --> 03:49.420
but each has an agenda of his own.

60
03:51.410 --> 03:52.460
Boling,

61
03:52.900 --> 03:54.570
I never expected that

62
03:55.130 --> 03:56.810
of the three guard battalion commanders

63
03:56.810 --> 03:59.010
who once served under the late Premier,

64
03:59.060 --> 04:00.990
Ye Ting would join the Communists,

65
04:01.020 --> 04:02.940
Zhang Fakui would join Wang Jingwei,

66
04:02.940 --> 04:05.970
only you would remain a loyal general

67
04:05.970 --> 04:07.570
in the revolutionary cause.

68
04:08.340 --> 04:10.740
You are a rare gifted commander.

69
04:11.500 --> 04:14.100
Thank you for your kind words, Generalissimo.

70
04:15.460 --> 04:16.660
Boling,

71
04:17.500 --> 04:20.500
Zhu and Mao's Communist army have fled north to Zunyi.

72
04:20.690 --> 04:22.980
What's your take on that?

73
04:34.620 --> 04:37.020
Generalissimo, since they entered Zunyi,

74
04:37.300 --> 04:39.580
their troop deployments and next move remain unclear.

75
04:39.580 --> 04:40.420
In my opinion,

76
04:40.440 --> 04:42.370
it is too early to launch an encirclement campaign.

77
04:42.370 --> 04:44.100
Tell me about your deployment.

78
04:44.120 --> 04:46.360
I've ordered Zhou Hunyuan's column

79
04:46.450 --> 04:48.680
to stay on the alert along the Wu River.

80
04:49.100 --> 04:50.659
I've ordered Wu Qiwei's column

81
04:50.659 --> 04:52.690
to defend Guiyang and Qingzhen

82
04:52.980 --> 04:54.860
to ensure Guiyang's safety.

83
04:54.860 --> 04:57.450
I've ordered the Sichuan Army, Hunan Army, and Yunnan Army

84
04:57.450 --> 05:00.240
to move part of their main forces into Guizhou as quickly as possible

85
05:00.240 --> 05:02.040
to encircle the Communist army.

86
05:02.260 --> 05:04.500
Meanwhile, the Guizhou Army will

87
05:02.400 --> 05:04.930
[Song Meiling, Chiang Kai-shek's wife]

88
05:04.570 --> 05:07.720
launch probing attacks around Zunyi

89
05:07.860 --> 05:10.100
to gauge the Communist Party's intentions,

90
05:10.100 --> 05:13.100
so we can carry out our next military plan.

91
05:14.740 --> 05:15.860
Boling.

92
05:19.010 --> 05:19.660
Madam.

93
05:20.620 --> 05:21.860
I knew you were coming,

94
05:21.860 --> 05:24.190
so I specially brought some gifts for you.

95
05:25.450 --> 05:26.510
One is a painkiller

96
05:26.510 --> 05:28.630
that I brought back from America.

97
05:29.210 --> 05:30.930
Guizhou is often damp and rainy.

98
05:30.930 --> 05:32.320
When your old injuries act up,

99
05:32.320 --> 05:34.890
take one. It works very well.

100
05:37.540 --> 05:40.570
Thank you for thinking of me, Madam.

101
05:41.530 --> 05:44.140
The other gift is from America too.

102
05:44.580 --> 05:45.690
It's pearl cream,

103
05:45.840 --> 05:47.570
for your wife, Shaowen.

104
05:47.810 --> 05:49.370
Tell her to use it every day.

105
05:49.520 --> 05:51.380
It will keep her looking radiant.

106
05:54.190 --> 05:57.550
Madam, she's still saving

107
05:57.950 --> 05:59.390
the rose cream you gave her last time.

108
05:59.390 --> 06:00.590
She must use it.

109
06:00.950 --> 06:02.880
Tell her not to be so stingy with it.

110
06:03.330 --> 06:04.620
Girls from our Wenchang

111
06:04.620 --> 06:06.080
are naturally beautiful,

112
06:06.100 --> 06:08.630
but they still need to take care of their skin.

113
06:09.770 --> 06:10.430
Have a seat.

114
06:11.300 --> 06:11.980
Yes.

115
06:12.110 --> 06:13.110
Boling,

116
06:13.740 --> 06:15.620
I think what you said just now

117
06:16.500 --> 06:17.890
was very good.

118
06:18.250 --> 06:19.510
I agree with your view.

119
06:19.860 --> 06:20.890
This Wang Jialie

120
06:21.160 --> 06:22.740
is just a rotten piece of wood.

121
06:22.740 --> 06:23.620
He's no threat.

122
06:23.770 --> 06:25.180
But Guizhou is a place

123
06:25.370 --> 06:27.010
that many eyes are watching.

124
06:28.010 --> 06:30.300
Zhu and Mao's Communist army has four eyes on it.

125
06:30.300 --> 06:32.690
Li and Bai in Guangxi have another four.

126
06:33.450 --> 06:34.010
Right,

127
06:34.330 --> 06:36.940
and Long Yun in Yunnan, that one-eyed man,

128
06:37.250 --> 06:39.010
is eyeing it greedily too.

129
06:40.570 --> 06:42.060
To knock out these eyes

130
06:42.330 --> 06:44.130
and prevent others from prying,

131
06:44.620 --> 06:47.080
no one is better suited than you, Xue Boling.

132
06:56.860 --> 06:57.790
Generalissimo.

133
06:59.130 --> 07:00.130
I will definitely

134
07:01.130 --> 07:02.620
live up to my mission.

135
07:07.130 --> 07:09.250
Everyone, don't push.

136
07:09.500 --> 07:11.060
There's enough for everyone.

137
07:11.060 --> 07:12.810
When the Red Army arrives, the poor smile.

138
07:12.810 --> 07:14.690
The warlord troops with opium pipes flee for their lives.

139
07:14.550 --> 07:15.860
[Mo Zemin, Political Commissar of the 15th Regiment of the Military Commission Column]

140
07:14.740 --> 07:16.570
We fight the landlords and overthrow the local tyrants

141
07:16.570 --> 07:18.450
to distribute grain and money.

142
07:18.450 --> 07:20.300
Fair trade is the most reasonable way to do business.

143
07:20.300 --> 07:21.770
Medical treatment and medicine are free.

144
07:21.770 --> 07:23.100
Come, come.

145
07:23.660 --> 07:25.100
Here, take it.

146
07:27.500 --> 07:29.330
Ma'am, please get up.

147
07:29.690 --> 07:30.890
We're all one family.

148
07:31.330 --> 07:33.860
There's nothing better than living a good life.

149
07:33.860 --> 07:35.450
You can also buy 3.5 kilos of salt

150
07:35.450 --> 07:36.980
for just one silver dollar.

151
07:37.300 --> 07:38.570
Very well.

152
07:40.130 --> 07:41.450
Take care.

153
07:43.740 --> 07:45.620
When the Red Army arrives, the poor smile.

154
07:45.620 --> 07:47.810
The warlord troops with opium pipes flee for their lives.

155
07:47.810 --> 07:50.100
We fight the landlords and overthrow the local tyrants

156
07:50.100 --> 07:51.830
to distribute grain and money.

157
07:52.010 --> 07:54.100
Fair trade is the most reasonable way to do business.

158
07:54.100 --> 07:55.690
Medical treatment and medicine are free.

159
07:55.690 --> 07:56.720
Take this medicine

160
07:56.720 --> 07:58.600
on schedule as I told you,

161
07:56.820 --> 07:58.260
[Long Yuqin, Medic of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

162
07:58.790 --> 07:59.860
and you'll get better soon.

163
07:59.860 --> 08:01.300
Okay, okay.

164
08:01.300 --> 08:01.890
All right. Thank you.

165
08:01.890 --> 08:03.420
Sir, I'll take one of these.

166
08:03.660 --> 08:04.320
Sure thing.

167
08:04.930 --> 08:06.370
Here's your meat.

168
08:06.400 --> 08:07.400
Here's the money.

169
08:07.770 --> 08:08.420
Good.

170
08:09.420 --> 08:10.820
Comrade, have some meat.

171
08:12.130 --> 08:12.370
Guo?

172
08:12.370 --> 08:13.860
This one. This one here.

173
08:13.980 --> 08:14.810
You're buying meat too?

174
08:14.810 --> 08:15.660
Yes, yes.

175
08:16.420 --> 08:17.100
Let me help you.

176
08:17.100 --> 08:17.760
Here you go.

177
08:19.370 --> 08:21.940
I'm getting some meat to improve...

178
08:21.940 --> 08:22.300
Oh.

179
08:22.300 --> 08:23.570
the meals for the soldiers in my company.

180
08:23.570 --> 08:24.570
That's 2.3 kilos.

181
08:24.770 --> 08:25.570
Then...

182
08:25.940 --> 08:28.540
give me a fattier cut to bring it up to 2.5 kilos.

183
08:28.860 --> 08:29.660
Comrade,

184
08:29.740 --> 08:30.860
I can give you a little more lean meat.

185
08:30.860 --> 08:32.090
If I give you a fattier cut,

186
08:32.090 --> 08:34.289
it's not easy to sell the rest of my meat.

187
08:35.260 --> 08:35.850
Then...

188
08:36.140 --> 08:37.049
lean meat is fine.

189
08:37.049 --> 08:38.179
-That'll do. -All right.

190
08:38.179 --> 08:38.960
How about this one?

191
08:38.960 --> 08:40.159
All right, all right.

192
08:43.679 --> 08:45.260
That's 2.5 kilos. Just right.

193
08:45.260 --> 08:46.240
Please put it here.

194
08:46.240 --> 08:46.880
Okay.

195
08:47.210 --> 08:48.020
Here you are.

196
08:49.190 --> 08:50.450
Have a look at the meat.

197
08:52.850 --> 08:55.180
Here's the money. Exactly one dollar.

198
08:56.940 --> 08:57.810
Comrade.

199
08:58.140 --> 09:00.090
I've never seen this kind of money before.

200
09:00.090 --> 09:01.570
It's our Red Army currency.

201
09:01.570 --> 09:02.970
If you don't want to keep them,

202
09:02.970 --> 09:04.610
you can exchange them at an exchange office at any time

203
09:04.610 --> 09:05.810
for silver dollars.

204
09:06.090 --> 09:07.790
One Red Army dollar

205
09:07.810 --> 09:10.070
can be exchanged for 1.2 silver dollars.

206
09:10.150 --> 09:11.310
It's a good deal.

207
09:12.020 --> 09:13.180
Help me out, please.

208
09:15.330 --> 09:17.160
Comrade, this money...

209
09:17.180 --> 09:18.090
It's a good deal.

210
09:18.090 --> 09:19.450
He's telling the truth.

211
09:19.780 --> 09:20.810
If you don't want to accept Red Army currency,

212
09:20.810 --> 09:21.930
you can exchange it for salt instead.

213
09:21.930 --> 09:23.780
Look, I just exchanged some myself.

214
09:23.780 --> 09:24.850
It's all good.

215
09:24.870 --> 09:25.900
Don't worry about this.

216
09:25.900 --> 09:27.330
-I'm off. -All right.

217
09:27.330 --> 09:27.900
Take care, Guo.

218
09:27.900 --> 09:28.570
Let's go.

219
09:28.900 --> 09:29.810
Gou Yazi.

220
09:31.680 --> 09:32.370
Gou Yazi.

221
09:37.210 --> 09:39.540
The traditional flavors of Guizhou!

222
09:39.940 --> 09:41.730
Freshly simmered mutton soup!

223
09:42.190 --> 09:43.760
Extra chili, extra meat!

224
09:43.780 --> 09:46.020
Sir, one bowl of mutton rice noodles, please.

225
09:46.020 --> 09:46.540
Come on.

226
09:46.540 --> 09:47.540
Have a seat first.

227
09:48.090 --> 09:49.300
It smells so good.

228
09:50.570 --> 09:53.300
Fresh, delicious mutton rice noodles!

229
09:53.870 --> 09:56.930
Help yourself to the chili. The vinegar's on the table.

230
09:56.970 --> 09:57.850
Young comrade,

231
09:57.940 --> 09:59.310
would you like a bowl of mutton rice noodles?

232
09:59.310 --> 10:00.580
They're delicious.

233
10:01.180 --> 10:02.180
Gou Yazi,

234
10:02.570 --> 10:03.660
why did you run off like that?

235
10:03.660 --> 10:05.180
I thought I'd lost you.

236
10:07.390 --> 10:09.450
Do you want some mutton rice noodles?

237
10:09.570 --> 10:11.070
These mutton rice noodles are delicious.

238
10:11.070 --> 10:12.200
The meat is so fresh.

239
10:13.020 --> 10:14.420
I told you to spend money wisely.

240
10:14.420 --> 10:15.540
You need to save your money.

241
10:15.540 --> 10:17.460
Why did you buy so much candy?

242
10:17.580 --> 10:18.770
You should've bought salt instead.

243
10:18.770 --> 10:21.780
Help yourself to the chili. The vinegar's on the table.

244
10:21.780 --> 10:22.850
Salt isn't sweet.

245
10:23.820 --> 10:24.590
Wait.

246
10:27.280 --> 10:28.850
Fresh mutton rice noodles!

247
10:28.870 --> 10:31.620
Ma'am, one bowl of mutton rice noodles, please.

248
10:31.780 --> 10:32.180
Okay.

249
10:32.180 --> 10:32.730
Add more meat.

250
10:32.730 --> 10:34.330
Do you want everything in it?

251
10:35.150 --> 10:36.460
She's asking you.

252
10:40.270 --> 10:41.490
More... more chili, please.

253
10:41.490 --> 10:42.420
Sure thing.

254
10:42.570 --> 10:43.540
Just one bowl?

255
10:43.940 --> 10:44.810
Yes.

256
10:45.170 --> 10:45.570
Okay.

257
10:45.660 --> 10:46.570
Young comrade.

258
10:46.660 --> 10:48.210
Please take a seat inside. I'll come to you soon.

259
10:48.210 --> 10:48.420
Okay.

260
10:48.420 --> 10:49.350
Coming right up.

261
10:49.380 --> 10:50.180
Sit inside.

262
10:50.300 --> 10:51.380
Go find a seat!

263
11:00.940 --> 11:03.450
Here, sit down first. Careful, it's hot.

264
11:04.130 --> 11:04.930
Just one bowl?

265
11:04.940 --> 11:05.940
Yes.

266
11:05.970 --> 11:07.020
Okay.

267
11:17.490 --> 11:18.750
Go ahead and eat yours.

268
11:26.500 --> 11:28.030
I'm not having any. You eat.

269
11:28.340 --> 11:29.690
You eat. I'm not eating.

270
11:29.970 --> 11:31.450
I... I'm not eating.

271
11:31.450 --> 11:32.940
You eat.

272
11:37.230 --> 11:38.470
It's delicious.

273
11:38.870 --> 11:40.480
You eat it. I don't like meat.

274
11:40.510 --> 11:41.370
It's all yours.

275
11:51.780 --> 11:53.140
Eat slowly.

276
12:26.930 --> 12:27.540
Here you go.

277
12:27.540 --> 12:28.210
What's your name?

278
12:28.210 --> 12:29.140
My name is Li Erniu.

279
12:29.100 --> 12:31.350
[Liu Ying, Chief of the Local Work Section, General Political Department of the Red Army]

280
12:29.170 --> 12:30.210
Li Erniu,

281
12:30.850 --> 12:31.690
how old are you?

282
12:31.690 --> 12:32.850
One at a time.

283
12:33.850 --> 12:35.210
No pushing, please.

284
12:35.210 --> 12:36.730
Go sign up over there first.

285
12:36.730 --> 12:37.930
Everyone, everyone!

286
12:38.020 --> 12:39.660
Everyone, listen up, all right?

287
12:39.660 --> 12:40.280
We need to

288
12:40.300 --> 12:41.450
sign up here.

289
12:41.690 --> 12:42.690
Once you've signed up,

290
12:42.690 --> 12:44.490
go to the front and collect your uniforms, all right?

291
12:44.490 --> 12:45.220
One at a time.

292
12:45.300 --> 12:46.570
Don't crowd around, okay?

293
12:46.570 --> 12:47.450
Okay. Okay.

294
12:47.450 --> 12:49.260
I was here first!

295
12:49.810 --> 12:50.870
Where are you from?

296
12:51.020 --> 12:51.650
Tongzi.

297
12:51.730 --> 12:52.330
Tongzi.

298
12:53.420 --> 12:55.180
All right. Go get your uniform.

299
12:55.450 --> 12:56.140
Okay.

300
12:56.330 --> 12:56.690
Move, hurry.

301
12:56.690 --> 12:57.540
My turn! My turn!

302
12:57.540 --> 12:59.490
My name is Zhang Quanwu. Zhang Quanwu.

303
12:59.490 --> 13:01.900
You'll need to complete some training first.

304
13:01.900 --> 13:03.560
Go ahead and get your uniform.

305
13:08.730 --> 13:10.090
Have a look, can we two join?

306
13:10.090 --> 13:10.570
Sure.

307
13:10.780 --> 13:11.540
Go sign up over there.

308
13:11.540 --> 13:13.450
Once you've signed up, you can join the Red Army.

309
13:13.450 --> 13:14.380
Let's go.

310
13:14.710 --> 13:17.960
[Lenin Elementary School is now enrolling]

311
13:30.360 --> 13:31.090
Kids.

312
13:31.380 --> 13:32.260
Folks.

313
13:32.690 --> 13:34.850
Welcome to learn how to read

314
13:35.090 --> 13:36.140
and write with me.

315
13:36.250 --> 13:38.060
Sir, are you holding class again?

316
13:38.060 --> 13:39.260
The road is full of flames of war,

317
13:39.260 --> 13:40.180
but the heart is like a spring breeze and rain.

318
13:40.110 --> 13:42.810
[Wei Yueqiao, Staff of the 2nd Bureau, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

319
13:40.660 --> 13:42.140
Comrades learn as they march,

320
13:42.140 --> 13:43.090
and I teach along the way.

321
13:43.090 --> 13:44.090
Comrade,

322
13:44.720 --> 13:46.670
do you charge for lessons?

323
13:46.690 --> 13:48.140
As long as everyone wants to learn,

324
13:48.140 --> 13:49.300
I won't charge a single cent.

325
13:49.300 --> 13:50.090
Really?

326
13:50.260 --> 13:51.330
That's great.

327
13:51.610 --> 13:54.410
-Then I'll bring my child here. -Great.

328
13:55.060 --> 13:56.460
Is learning to read hard?

329
14:00.850 --> 14:03.260
Kid, do you find husking corn difficult?

330
14:03.420 --> 14:04.180
No.

331
14:04.330 --> 14:06.140
I've been doing it since I was little.

332
14:06.140 --> 14:07.600
It's not difficult at all.

333
14:08.050 --> 14:10.450
Learning to read is just like husking corn.

334
14:10.690 --> 14:12.950
As long as you keep writing and learning,

335
14:13.180 --> 14:14.240
you'll get the hang of it.

336
14:14.240 --> 14:14.980
Do you want to learn?

337
14:14.980 --> 14:16.110
Then I want to learn.

338
14:16.540 --> 14:17.450
I want to learn!

339
14:17.810 --> 14:19.060
I want to learn too.

340
14:20.300 --> 14:21.040
I want to learn too.

341
14:21.040 --> 14:22.210
As long as everyone wants to learn,

342
14:22.210 --> 14:23.380
everyone is welcome to come and learn.

343
14:23.380 --> 14:24.660
Can my child come too, then?

344
14:24.660 --> 14:25.490
Sure.

345
14:26.540 --> 14:28.210
It's different when the Red Army comes.

346
14:28.210 --> 14:29.870
Everyone is welcome to learn.

347
14:30.380 --> 14:33.180
Why isn't Comrade Luofu back yet?

348
14:37.180 --> 14:39.610
Why isn't Comrade Luofu back yet?

349
14:44.020 --> 14:46.180
Why isn't Comrade Luofu back yet?

350
14:45.980 --> 14:48.370
[Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

351
14:47.820 --> 14:49.100
Comrade Jiaxiang.

352
14:48.500 --> 14:50.650
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

353
14:49.870 --> 14:51.160
What you just said

354
14:51.180 --> 14:52.330
sounds like

355
14:52.890 --> 14:54.280
an echo in a valley.

356
14:57.140 --> 14:58.570
Be patient.

357
14:59.570 --> 15:00.940
Be patient.

358
15:01.810 --> 15:03.260
Be patient.

359
15:05.690 --> 15:08.330
Currently, the 1st, 3rd, 5th, and 9th Army Corps

360
15:08.330 --> 15:10.060
have set up perimeter defenses

361
15:10.140 --> 15:11.490
around Zunyi.

362
15:11.730 --> 15:13.850
Based on the intelligence we have on the enemy,

363
15:13.850 --> 15:16.050
the enemy is unlikely to threaten Zunyi

364
15:16.140 --> 15:17.200
for the time being.

365
15:17.570 --> 15:19.370
We are confident that the troops

366
15:19.490 --> 15:20.940
can have a short period of rest.

367
15:20.940 --> 15:21.450
Good.

368
15:22.450 --> 15:23.380
Notify all Corps

369
15:23.380 --> 15:24.520
not to let their guard down.

370
15:24.180 --> 15:26.670
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission (CRMC); Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

371
15:24.940 --> 15:26.180
Especially over the next few days,

372
15:26.180 --> 15:27.940
we must ensure Zunyi remains secure.

373
15:27.940 --> 15:28.450
Okay.

374
15:28.040 --> 15:30.710
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of the General Staff of the Red Army and concurrently Commander of the Military Commission Column]

375
15:28.570 --> 15:30.330
I'll telegraph all the corps right away

376
15:30.330 --> 15:33.060
to reiterate the General Headquarters' orders.

377
15:34.280 --> 15:38.080
Let's shoot when we get the ball. The more we shoot, the more we score.

378
15:38.670 --> 15:39.930
Commander-in-Chief.

379
15:40.060 --> 15:40.970
Catch it!

380
15:41.180 --> 15:43.400
Commander-in-Chief, I hear the other team is pretty strong.

381
15:43.400 --> 15:45.660
We're counting on your long shots today.

382
15:54.500 --> 15:55.570
Commander-in-Chief, let's go.

383
15:55.570 --> 15:56.780
The basketball game against Zunyi Middle School

384
15:56.780 --> 15:57.650
is about to start.

385
15:57.650 --> 15:58.650
Okay, I'm coming.

386
16:10.050 --> 16:12.480
[He Zizhen, Mao Zedong's wife]

387
16:12.380 --> 16:13.470
Runzhi.

388
16:19.210 --> 16:20.020
Mrs. Mao?

389
16:20.140 --> 16:20.850
Mrs. Mao?

390
16:22.480 --> 16:24.680
Zizhen, why are you here?

391
16:25.380 --> 16:27.020
Mr. Dong, Mr. Xie, and Mr. Xu sent me here.

392
16:27.020 --> 16:29.060
They said you've been working hard these past few days,

393
16:29.060 --> 16:30.740
so they asked me to come look after you.

394
16:30.740 --> 16:31.670
Let me take that.

395
16:31.690 --> 16:32.890
No, you don't have to.

396
16:35.260 --> 16:37.060
That's very thoughtful of them.

397
16:37.210 --> 16:39.010
You're carrying so many things.

398
16:39.540 --> 16:39.860
Let's go.

399
16:39.860 --> 16:40.860
This is for you.

400
16:42.180 --> 16:43.510
Comrade Zizhen is here.

401
16:43.570 --> 16:44.630
Comrade Jiaxiang.

402
16:44.660 --> 16:45.690
How far along are you now?

403
16:45.690 --> 16:46.800
A little over eight months.

404
16:46.800 --> 16:49.020
You're eight months pregnant, and you're still carrying all this?

405
16:49.020 --> 16:50.610
Go upstairs and lie down for a bit.

406
16:50.610 --> 16:51.420
I'm not tired.

407
16:51.850 --> 16:53.690
I'll sit here and enjoy the sunshine with you.

408
16:53.690 --> 16:55.140
You were out in the sun the whole way here.

409
16:55.140 --> 16:56.380
Why sit out in the sun any longer?

410
16:56.380 --> 16:57.330
Go upstairs and lie down for a while now.

411
16:57.330 --> 16:57.730
I just got here.

412
16:57.730 --> 16:59.250
Why are you so eager to send me upstairs?

413
16:59.250 --> 17:00.810
I'm not tired. Let me sit here for a bit.

414
17:00.810 --> 17:02.140
Careful... don't move.

415
17:06.380 --> 17:06.950
Come on.

416
17:09.450 --> 17:10.579
Is everything okay?

417
17:11.579 --> 17:13.240
Up and down, you know how it is.

418
17:26.859 --> 17:27.790
That's fine too.

419
17:28.420 --> 17:31.080
The three of us can enjoy the sunshine together.

420
17:32.010 --> 17:33.140
Comrade Zedong,

421
17:34.470 --> 17:35.520
who are the three?

422
17:35.550 --> 17:36.680
Am I one of the three?

423
17:39.610 --> 17:42.010
Let me ask the baby if we should count you in.

424
17:46.940 --> 17:48.010
The baby said something.

425
17:48.010 --> 17:49.160
Then there are four of us.

426
17:49.160 --> 17:50.090
Thank you.

427
17:52.050 --> 17:53.850
Everyone counts, big and small.

428
18:17.130 --> 18:19.760
I collected these for you bit by bit

429
18:19.780 --> 18:20.930
from Tongdao,

430
18:21.070 --> 18:22.590
Liping, and Houchang.

431
18:22.910 --> 18:24.360
I arranged them by date.

432
18:24.380 --> 18:25.980
The most recent one is on top.

433
18:27.100 --> 18:27.900
Good.

434
18:52.190 --> 18:53.320
Comrade Zedong,

435
18:53.660 --> 18:54.790
the elder gentlemen

436
18:54.900 --> 18:56.700
sending Comrade Zizhen here now

437
18:57.050 --> 18:58.270
has a deeper meaning.

438
18:59.480 --> 19:01.940
Everyone's looking forward to the meeting.

439
19:33.180 --> 19:33.890
Comrade Luofu.

440
19:33.890 --> 19:34.750
Comrade Enlai.

441
19:34.860 --> 19:35.660
How did the meeting go?

442
19:35.660 --> 19:36.490
We had a discussion.

443
19:36.490 --> 19:38.180
Comrade Bo Gu agreed to carry out

444
19:38.180 --> 19:39.970
the decision made at the Liping Politburo meeting

445
19:39.970 --> 19:42.380
to hold an expanded Politburo meeting in Zunyi.

446
19:42.380 --> 19:43.450
He'll deliver the main report

447
19:43.450 --> 19:45.420
on the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign at the meeting.

448
19:45.420 --> 19:47.770
I'll give a supplementary report on military affairs.

449
19:47.770 --> 19:48.530
Very good.

450
19:48.730 --> 19:49.930
Has the date been set?

451
19:50.050 --> 19:51.940
It's tentatively scheduled for the 15th,

452
19:51.830 --> 19:53.970
[Zhou Enlai, CPC Central Committee Politburo Standing Committee, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission, General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

453
19:51.970 --> 19:53.260
the day after tomorrow.

454
19:53.260 --> 19:55.210
This will give the leaders of each Corps

455
19:55.210 --> 19:56.770
enough time to get to Zunyi for the meeting.

456
19:56.770 --> 19:57.580
Very well.

457
19:57.860 --> 19:58.680
I'll go back now

458
19:58.680 --> 20:01.180
and tell Comrade Zedong and Comrade Jiaxiang the news.

459
20:01.180 --> 20:02.290
We should prepare properly too.

460
20:02.180 --> 20:03.790
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Political Bureau Standing Committee of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

461
20:02.420 --> 20:04.590
This time, we must discuss everything thoroughly,

462
20:04.590 --> 20:06.790
and resolve the issues once and for all.

463
20:30.970 --> 20:32.140
In just a short while,

464
20:32.140 --> 20:34.670
I've taken out an entire reinforced platoon.

465
20:36.340 --> 20:37.580
It didn't itch before,

466
20:37.580 --> 20:39.640
but your scratching made it itchy.

467
20:39.730 --> 20:40.560
Then it's my fault.

468
20:40.560 --> 20:41.340
I won't scratch it anymore.

469
20:41.340 --> 20:42.100
Don't.

470
20:42.560 --> 20:43.580
Now that you've spotted the enemies,

471
20:43.580 --> 20:44.940
you should take them out.

472
20:44.940 --> 20:45.660
Come on.

473
20:47.730 --> 20:48.490
Wrong spot.

474
20:48.690 --> 20:49.380
Where?

475
20:49.620 --> 20:50.380
East.

476
20:50.610 --> 20:51.940
Scratch farther to the east.

477
20:51.940 --> 20:54.100
How am I supposed to know which way is east on your back?

478
20:54.100 --> 20:56.360
It's right between the shoulder blade and the spine.

479
20:56.360 --> 20:57.380
Heavy enemy forces are massing there.

480
20:57.380 --> 20:58.100
Here?

481
21:00.210 --> 21:01.660
There are other spots too.

482
21:01.660 --> 21:03.860
My back is currently ruled by warlords.

483
21:03.970 --> 21:04.940
Comrade Zedong,

484
21:05.140 --> 21:07.420
the enemy situation on your side is complicated.

485
21:07.420 --> 21:08.180
That's why

486
21:08.380 --> 21:11.180
we need to "act vigorously, quickly, and firmly."

487
21:11.660 --> 21:12.380
That's it!

488
21:12.580 --> 21:13.690
Here?

489
21:16.860 --> 21:18.660
Focus and eliminate the target!

490
21:19.970 --> 21:20.700
Right here.

491
21:22.530 --> 21:24.590
Qiu, bring my stretcher over.

492
21:25.710 --> 21:26.280
Yes, sir!

493
21:26.310 --> 21:28.020
I can't watch this any longer.

494
21:28.790 --> 21:31.120
Comrade Jiaxiang, you don't understand.

495
21:31.180 --> 21:33.780
The simplest pleasure is life's greatest joy.

496
21:36.100 --> 21:37.420
Any other battlefields?

497
21:37.420 --> 21:38.080
Head north.

498
21:38.180 --> 21:39.050
North?

499
21:39.340 --> 21:40.670
All the way to the north.

500
21:41.860 --> 21:42.690
Right there!

501
21:43.270 --> 21:45.000
Have I taken them all out, Comrade Chairman?

502
21:45.000 --> 21:46.200
Most of them are gone.

503
21:48.290 --> 21:49.180
Alright.

504
21:50.050 --> 21:51.100
Stop pinching.

505
21:51.230 --> 21:52.770
Just give me your clothes and Runzhi's later,

506
21:52.770 --> 21:54.230
and I'll boil them for you.

507
21:54.860 --> 21:56.530
Thank you, Mrs. Mao.

508
21:57.160 --> 21:57.850
Thank you.

509
21:57.910 --> 21:58.680
Chief.

510
21:59.380 --> 22:00.100
Hello, Mrs. Mao.

511
22:00.100 --> 22:00.860
Chen Geng.

512
22:01.210 --> 22:02.420
It's good to see you here.

513
22:02.420 --> 22:03.500
[Chen Geng, Regiment Commander of the Cadre Regiment of the 1st Military Commission Column]

514
22:02.490 --> 22:04.550
But you didn't have to buy me the fish.

515
22:05.050 --> 22:07.140
Chairman, you've misunderstood.

516
22:08.290 --> 22:09.860
I bought this fish for He

517
22:09.980 --> 22:11.780
to help her regain her strength.

518
22:12.050 --> 22:12.640
I bought this fish

519
22:12.640 --> 22:14.450
with the money left over from my meal allowance.

520
22:14.450 --> 22:16.650
I absolutely haven't broken any rules.

521
22:16.730 --> 22:17.660
Fish is good.

522
22:17.690 --> 22:18.910
Runzhi loves fish.

523
22:18.940 --> 22:20.270
I was going to buy one myself,

524
22:20.270 --> 22:23.070
but since you bought one, you've saved me the trip.

525
22:23.210 --> 22:24.470
-I've saved a little from my meal allowance too. -No, no, no.

526
22:24.470 --> 22:25.530
I'll give you the money.

527
22:25.530 --> 22:26.380
You keep it for now.

528
22:26.380 --> 22:28.180
You have two mouths to feed now.

529
22:28.210 --> 22:29.530
I can't just take it from you for free.

530
22:29.530 --> 22:30.660
Just take the money.

531
22:31.490 --> 22:32.770
I'll skip the delivery fee this time.

532
22:32.770 --> 22:33.940
No delivery fee needed.

533
22:33.940 --> 22:35.970
Just let me have some soup when it's done.

534
22:35.970 --> 22:36.730
You'll get your share.

535
22:36.730 --> 22:37.690
Okay.

536
22:38.580 --> 22:40.620
We can only drink soup.

537
22:40.770 --> 22:41.620
That fish

538
22:41.770 --> 22:43.420
must be for Comrade Zedong.

539
22:43.450 --> 22:44.450
Right, right.

540
22:44.660 --> 22:45.690
The fish is good.

541
22:46.010 --> 22:48.180
But what I need more right now is food for the mind.

542
22:48.180 --> 22:49.070
Chairman.

543
22:50.770 --> 22:51.620
There is.

544
22:51.970 --> 22:53.580
I just passed by a bookstore

545
22:54.180 --> 22:56.420
and came across an issue of Taibai from last year.

546
22:56.420 --> 22:58.940
It has a short essay by Mr. Lu Xun.

547
23:00.570 --> 23:01.770
Let me read it to you.

548
23:04.790 --> 23:05.590
It's called

549
23:05.840 --> 23:08.490
"Have the Chinese Lost Their Self-Confidence?"

550
23:08.490 --> 23:10.040
Since ancient times,

551
23:10.210 --> 23:12.350
we have had men who worked doggedly in silence,

552
23:12.350 --> 23:14.100
men who worked stubbornly at the risk of their lives,

553
23:14.100 --> 23:15.580
who strove to save others,

554
23:16.170 --> 23:18.100
who braved death to seek the truth...

555
23:18.100 --> 23:21.210
Even the standard dynastic histories, which are really family records

556
23:21.210 --> 23:22.770
of emperors, princes, ministers and generals,

557
23:22.770 --> 23:25.050
cannot conceal their glory:

558
23:25.200 --> 23:28.280
these men are the backbone of China.

559
23:30.140 --> 23:31.180
Well written.

560
23:31.340 --> 23:32.210
Mr. Lu Xun

561
23:32.490 --> 23:35.340
doesn't just examine Chinese society under a microscope

562
23:35.340 --> 23:36.800
but also with a telescope.

563
23:37.380 --> 23:38.940
A microscope makes you see things clearly,

564
23:38.940 --> 23:40.800
and a telescope makes you see far.

565
23:40.860 --> 23:41.420
Right.

566
23:41.580 --> 23:42.420
Chen Geng,

567
23:42.970 --> 23:44.580
you've met Lu Xun, right?

568
23:44.730 --> 23:45.420
Yes.

569
23:45.660 --> 23:48.010
I heard he's planning to write

570
23:48.900 --> 23:50.620
a novel like "The Iron Flood."

571
23:50.970 --> 23:51.730
Is that true?

572
23:51.750 --> 23:52.580
It is.

573
23:52.920 --> 23:54.140
He even asked me to draw

574
23:54.140 --> 23:56.290
a sketch of how our Red Army fights.

575
23:56.450 --> 23:57.250
And I did.

576
23:57.860 --> 23:58.530
Good.

577
23:58.770 --> 23:59.900
When we have free time,

578
23:59.900 --> 24:02.300
let's invite Feng Xuefeng and Cheng Fangwu

579
24:02.450 --> 24:05.050
and start a Lu Xun reading group.

580
24:05.250 --> 24:06.570
After this Long March,

581
24:06.690 --> 24:08.530
when we read Lu Xun's works again,

582
24:08.530 --> 24:10.140
we'll surely feel different.

583
24:10.140 --> 24:11.450
You must count me in.

584
24:12.210 --> 24:14.180
Before I went abroad in 1925,

585
24:14.380 --> 24:16.770
I was especially fond of reading his books.

586
24:16.770 --> 24:19.290
Back then, any progressive intellectual

587
24:19.580 --> 24:21.140
admired him.

588
24:22.290 --> 24:23.380
Count me in, too.

589
24:23.620 --> 24:24.820
Of course we'll count you in,

590
24:24.820 --> 24:27.080
and we'll also invite Comrade Qu Qiubai.

591
24:27.900 --> 24:30.940
Qiubai was Lu Xun's rare kindred spirit.

592
24:32.370 --> 24:33.290
Comrade Zedong.

593
24:33.290 --> 24:34.340
Comrade Jiaxiang.

594
24:34.340 --> 24:34.970
I'm back.

595
24:35.340 --> 24:37.400
Comrade Luofu, you're finally back.

596
24:38.200 --> 24:39.180
Comrade Zizhen is here.

597
24:39.180 --> 24:40.050
Comrade Luofu.

598
24:41.210 --> 24:43.580
You talk. I'll go upstairs and get settled.

599
24:43.580 --> 24:45.620
Chen Geng, help Zizhen upstairs.

600
24:45.660 --> 24:46.200
Okay.

601
24:46.220 --> 24:46.970
I'll do it.

602
24:46.970 --> 24:47.500
Careful.

603
24:48.210 --> 24:49.010
Chen Geng.

604
24:49.490 --> 24:50.340
Here.

605
24:50.900 --> 24:52.010
You don't need to see me off.

606
24:52.010 --> 24:53.770
I've made it through four blockade lines.

607
24:53.770 --> 24:55.700
You think I can't climb the stairs?

608
24:55.900 --> 24:56.770
Which room?

609
24:56.860 --> 24:58.720
The east room on the second floor.

610
25:07.580 --> 25:09.640
Chen Geng, do you have anything else?

611
25:10.580 --> 25:11.530
I...

612
25:12.900 --> 25:13.730
Go back first.

613
25:14.490 --> 25:15.500
Once we have news,

614
25:15.530 --> 25:17.140
we'll let you know immediately.

615
25:17.140 --> 25:19.140
The comrades are all waiting.

616
25:29.580 --> 25:30.690
Come, Luofu.

617
25:31.210 --> 25:32.210
Sit down.

618
25:35.700 --> 25:37.500
Bo Gu has agreed

619
25:37.530 --> 25:39.010
to hold an expanded Politburo meeting.

620
25:39.010 --> 25:39.820
That's great.

621
25:40.100 --> 25:42.160
Has the meeting agenda been decided?

622
25:42.180 --> 25:43.580
Bo Gu will chair the meeting

623
25:43.580 --> 25:45.490
and deliver the main report reviewing

624
25:45.490 --> 25:47.040
the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign.

625
25:47.040 --> 25:50.340
Comrade Enlai will deliver a supplementary report on military matters.

626
25:50.340 --> 25:51.290
Comrade Zedong,

627
25:51.730 --> 25:52.860
what do you think?

628
25:53.250 --> 25:54.850
I'm not worried about Enlai.

629
25:55.860 --> 25:58.320
But I'm not optimistic about Bo Gu's report.

630
25:59.140 --> 26:00.420
So I think we should

631
26:00.770 --> 26:02.030
prepare our own report

632
26:02.690 --> 26:04.010
to state our views.

633
26:05.900 --> 26:07.730
As for who should deliver it,

634
26:08.050 --> 26:09.900
Comrade Zedong, it must be you.

635
26:11.490 --> 26:13.530
I'm not a standing member of the Politburo.

636
26:13.530 --> 26:14.940
My voice carries little weight.

637
26:14.940 --> 26:17.010
If I speak, it'll easily provoke resistance

638
26:17.010 --> 26:18.180
from Bo Gu and Li De,

639
26:18.340 --> 26:19.740
escalating the conflict

640
26:19.860 --> 26:21.340
and making it harder to resolve the problem.

641
26:21.340 --> 26:22.180
Then...

642
26:22.450 --> 26:24.730
I think you should deliver

643
26:24.940 --> 26:26.490
the report yourself, Comrade Luofu.

644
26:26.490 --> 26:27.440
You're a Standing Committee member,

645
26:27.440 --> 26:29.040
and you returned from the Soviet Union.

646
26:29.040 --> 26:31.320
Your report will carry more weight.

647
26:31.490 --> 26:32.550
Most importantly,

648
26:32.770 --> 26:34.820
Comrade Luofu, your writing and speaking skills

649
26:34.820 --> 26:35.900
are second to none.

650
26:36.180 --> 26:37.640
I see no problem with that.

651
26:39.690 --> 26:41.340
But I'm no expert on military matters.

652
26:41.340 --> 26:43.380
Three cobblers can outwit Zhuge Liang.

653
26:43.380 --> 26:44.420
With Jiaxiang and me here,

654
26:44.420 --> 26:45.860
how could we let you handle this alone?

655
26:45.860 --> 26:46.390
Exactly.

656
26:46.560 --> 26:47.860
Then I feel more confident.

657
26:47.860 --> 26:49.210
Let's not delay. Let's get to work now.

658
26:49.210 --> 26:50.010
Let's go.

659
26:51.690 --> 26:52.520
Let's go.

660
26:56.630 --> 26:58.570
You're an absolute jerk!

661
26:57.210 --> 26:58.290
[Li De, Military Adviser of the Communist International]

662
26:59.860 --> 27:00.610
What is this?

663
27:00.970 --> 27:02.180
What kind of dish is this?

664
27:02.180 --> 27:03.050
Answer me!

665
27:03.570 --> 27:05.100
Are you trying to poison me?

666
27:05.380 --> 27:07.100
You've been with me for so many years.

667
27:07.100 --> 27:09.140
You know I can't eat spicy food.

668
27:09.380 --> 27:10.580
Are you trying to poison me?

669
27:10.580 --> 27:11.980
My stomach hurts so much!

670
27:12.140 --> 27:13.570
I can't eat chilies.

671
27:13.940 --> 27:15.580
Why can't you understand?

672
27:17.270 --> 27:18.470
Comrade Xiao Yuehua,

673
27:18.550 --> 27:19.480
what's going on?

674
27:19.970 --> 27:21.770
I was doing the laundry just now.

675
27:22.180 --> 27:24.040
The guard brought this meal over.

676
27:24.490 --> 27:26.350
I didn't know it had chilies in it.

677
27:26.730 --> 27:29.060
He insists that I was trying to poison him.

678
27:29.100 --> 27:30.070
She was trying to poison me!

679
27:30.070 --> 27:30.870
Comrade Li De,

680
27:31.210 --> 27:32.610
what kind of attitude is that?

681
27:32.610 --> 27:33.780
[Wu Xiuquan, Translator]

682
27:32.740 --> 27:34.140
Xiao Yuehua is your wife,

683
27:34.420 --> 27:35.950
but she is also our comrade.

684
27:36.940 --> 27:37.860
Those of us who baptized in

685
27:37.860 --> 27:39.450
the spirit of the May Fourth Movement,

686
27:39.450 --> 27:40.660
our initial motivation for joining the revolution

687
27:40.660 --> 27:43.050
was the pursuit of equality and democracy.

688
27:41.650 --> 27:44.120
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

689
27:43.530 --> 27:45.210
You are equal to each other.

690
27:45.580 --> 27:46.840
In terms of family relations,

691
27:46.840 --> 27:48.690
you should also treat each other as equals.

692
27:48.690 --> 27:51.360
You're equals. You can't treat her like this.

693
27:54.160 --> 27:55.360
Comrade Xiao Yuehua.

694
27:55.580 --> 27:57.120
I'm sorry you have to put up with this.

695
27:57.120 --> 27:58.210
Go inside and rest for a while.

696
27:58.210 --> 27:59.290
I'm fine.

697
27:59.970 --> 28:01.500
I'll clean this up.

698
28:03.250 --> 28:04.140
Comrade Li De.

699
28:04.580 --> 28:06.250
Why are you getting so worked up?

700
28:06.250 --> 28:07.450
You need to calm down.

701
28:07.690 --> 28:09.860
Bo Gu, they all treat me this way.

702
28:10.130 --> 28:11.450
You'll understand how I feel.

703
28:11.450 --> 28:12.850
I've said it so many times

704
28:12.860 --> 28:14.140
that I can't eat spicy food.

705
28:14.140 --> 28:15.590
They did this on purpose.

706
28:15.620 --> 28:17.180
They deliberately put chilies in my food.

707
28:17.180 --> 28:19.040
Eating chilies is a local custom.

708
28:19.180 --> 28:20.510
No one is targeting you.

709
28:21.220 --> 28:24.280
People in Jiangxi eat spicy food too.

710
28:24.620 --> 28:27.770
They never put chilies in my food back there.

711
28:28.770 --> 28:31.970
Maybe you should try to adapt to the local customs sooner.

712
28:45.240 --> 28:46.090
Clean it up.

713
29:00.380 --> 29:01.580
Comrade Xiao Yuehua,

714
29:02.140 --> 29:03.970
I'd like to speak with Comrade Li De alone.

715
29:03.970 --> 29:04.970
Is that all right?

716
29:05.250 --> 29:05.920
Okay.

717
29:13.820 --> 29:14.550
Close the door on your way out.

718
29:14.550 --> 29:15.180
Okay.

719
29:26.510 --> 29:29.640
Comrade Zhang Wentian, Comrade Enlai and I have decided

720
29:30.210 --> 29:33.810
to hold an expanded Politburo meeting in Zunyi.

721
29:34.870 --> 29:35.870
Why?

722
29:38.340 --> 29:41.860
The decision was made at the Liping Meeting.

723
29:42.180 --> 29:43.970
Everyone agreed.

724
29:44.530 --> 29:46.690
It's inner-party democracy.

725
29:47.290 --> 29:50.010
Besides, after the Xiang River Battle,

726
29:50.290 --> 29:55.100
we really should sit down and discuss a few things.

727
29:57.820 --> 29:58.750
Bo Gu, do you know

728
29:59.380 --> 30:00.910
they're using the fact that

729
30:01.860 --> 30:03.990
we've lost contact with the Comintern

730
30:04.940 --> 30:06.620
to overturn everything?

731
30:08.450 --> 30:09.730
Overturn everything?

732
30:10.070 --> 30:11.650
Yes, overturn everything.

733
30:13.960 --> 30:15.640
Surely it won't come to that.

734
30:17.050 --> 30:19.250
The decision made at the Liping Meeting

735
30:19.580 --> 30:20.940
was to

736
30:20.940 --> 30:21.770
review the 5th

737
30:21.770 --> 30:23.310
Counter-Encirclement Campaign

738
30:23.310 --> 30:26.660
and draw lessons from it.

739
30:28.340 --> 30:29.690
Let me remind you:

740
30:29.820 --> 30:32.300
as a member of the Troika,

741
30:32.730 --> 30:34.620
I made all the

742
30:34.640 --> 30:36.300
military command decisions.

743
30:36.340 --> 30:40.100
And you're the one in charge.

744
30:42.960 --> 30:45.680
If they want to overturn everything to settle scores,

745
30:45.680 --> 30:48.530
we can't just let them do whatever they want.

746
30:51.660 --> 30:53.980
I've already suggested to Zhou Enlai

747
30:54.210 --> 30:56.970
that I should deliver the main report

748
30:56.970 --> 31:01.250
and he will give a supplementary report on military matters.

749
31:02.620 --> 31:03.730
Besides,

750
31:03.750 --> 31:06.110
I also talked to Comrade Kaifeng,

751
31:06.640 --> 31:10.290
asking him to communicate more

752
31:10.310 --> 31:11.910
with the cadres in each Corp.

753
31:12.040 --> 31:12.790
Good.

754
31:13.860 --> 31:14.860
That's very good.

755
31:16.620 --> 31:17.930
That's excellent.

756
31:23.420 --> 31:24.940
Comrade Li De,

757
31:25.380 --> 31:29.410
you will attend the meeting as usual.

758
31:36.340 --> 31:37.210
Okay.

759
31:45.550 --> 31:46.550
Eat.

760
31:47.710 --> 31:48.570
It's not spicy.

761
32:01.290 --> 32:02.260
You're back.

762
32:04.380 --> 32:05.710
Why are you still awake?

763
32:06.340 --> 32:08.670
I couldn't sleep well while you were away.

764
32:10.250 --> 32:11.530
I'm back now.

765
32:11.580 --> 32:13.440
Now you can get some proper sleep.

766
32:14.140 --> 32:15.820
I heated up the fish soup for you.

767
32:15.820 --> 32:17.380
How did you know I was hungry?

768
32:17.380 --> 32:18.840
Isn't it always like this?

769
32:19.290 --> 32:21.730
Whenever you stay up late chatting with people,

770
32:21.730 --> 32:22.940
you come back hungry.

771
32:31.490 --> 32:33.220
Wash your hands and face first.

772
32:35.290 --> 32:35.970
I can't wait.

773
32:35.970 --> 32:37.380
Then sit down and have some.

774
32:37.380 --> 32:39.580
Have your soup while you soak your feet.

775
33:01.100 --> 33:02.100
Give me your feet.

776
33:14.660 --> 33:15.720
Before I came here,

777
33:15.830 --> 33:16.870
Mr. Dong, Mr. Xu,

778
33:16.900 --> 33:19.580
Ms. Deng and Ms. Cai came to see me.

779
33:19.770 --> 33:21.230
They didn't say anything,

780
33:21.490 --> 33:23.100
but I knew what they meant.

781
33:25.290 --> 33:26.580
For the past two years,

782
33:27.250 --> 33:29.780
I know you've been frustrated for a long time.

783
33:30.500 --> 33:33.290
But at tomorrow's meeting,

784
33:33.590 --> 33:35.650
you have to keep your temper in check.

785
33:35.970 --> 33:37.420
Don't get angry

786
33:37.420 --> 33:39.070
and start shouting and banging the table.

787
33:39.070 --> 33:41.930
If you have any grievances, come home and talk to me.

788
33:42.900 --> 33:43.970
Can I tell you?

789
33:44.450 --> 33:45.210
Of course.

790
33:47.240 --> 33:48.440
I have no grievances.

791
33:49.490 --> 33:51.150
In the past two or three years,

792
33:51.180 --> 33:54.110
whatever grievances I felt back then have faded now.

793
33:54.660 --> 33:55.770
Rest assured.

794
33:56.210 --> 33:58.010
No matter how wronged I feel,

795
33:59.530 --> 34:02.450
it can never put out the fire inside me.

796
34:11.010 --> 34:12.270
The water is a bit cold.

797
34:12.320 --> 34:13.120
It's not cold.

798
34:13.230 --> 34:13.830
Come here.

799
34:13.889 --> 34:15.340
You've walked such a long way today.

800
34:15.340 --> 34:17.070
You should soak your feet, too.

801
34:17.090 --> 34:17.710
Come on.

802
34:19.449 --> 34:20.699
No need.

803
34:23.650 --> 34:24.860
I already did.

804
34:27.020 --> 34:28.350
Don't move. Let me do it.

805
34:30.380 --> 34:31.150
Let me do it.

806
34:35.260 --> 34:36.170
Like this.

807
34:36.530 --> 34:38.989
Put your feet here. I'll give them a massage.

808
35:02.820 --> 35:04.220
Runzhi, you've changed.

809
35:04.530 --> 35:06.460
You've learned to care for people.

810
35:07.720 --> 35:09.520
Haven't I always been like this?

811
35:19.010 --> 35:19.900
I had a dream.

812
35:20.220 --> 35:21.970
I dreamed about Maomao.

813
35:22.420 --> 35:24.280
I dreamed that Maomao had grown up

814
35:24.450 --> 35:26.130
into a young man.

815
35:26.820 --> 35:29.780
He was crying and shouting that he wanted a wife.

816
35:30.300 --> 35:32.340
I wonder what kind of personality

817
35:33.010 --> 35:34.870
Maomao will have when he grows up.

818
35:35.010 --> 35:36.430
Anyway, he can't have your temper.

819
35:36.430 --> 35:37.800
You have quite a temper.

820
35:54.570 --> 35:55.170
What is it?

821
35:55.190 --> 35:56.340
You're not listening to me again.

822
35:56.340 --> 35:57.200
I am listening.

823
35:58.450 --> 36:00.610
You don't even know whether you're having a boy or a girl,

824
36:00.610 --> 36:02.780
and you're already thinking about getting him a wife.

825
36:02.780 --> 36:04.310
I was talking about Maomao.

826
36:09.050 --> 36:11.010
Sorry. I got distracted.

827
36:11.900 --> 36:13.260
It's fine.

828
36:13.700 --> 36:15.370
Anyway, once you get distracted,

829
36:15.370 --> 36:16.830
nothing can pull you back.

830
36:18.060 --> 36:20.150
I'll pay more attention.

831
36:23.450 --> 36:24.780
If it's a boy,

832
36:25.220 --> 36:27.900
and he has your personality,

833
36:29.820 --> 36:32.150
he'll have a hard time finding a wife, too.

834
36:35.320 --> 36:36.030
Don't move.

835
36:36.670 --> 36:37.830
Alright, alright.

836
36:37.850 --> 36:39.510
I'll give your feet a good rub.

837
36:49.720 --> 36:53.680
[January 15, 1935, Morning]

838
38:21.960 --> 38:23.000
Refreshing!

839
38:24.220 --> 38:26.220
Comrade Zedong, it's time to go.

840
38:26.580 --> 38:28.110
Jiaxiang, let's go.

841
38:35.970 --> 38:36.650
Come here.

842
38:38.870 --> 38:40.160
Here, wipe your hands.

843
39:11.520 --> 39:12.350
Jiaxiang,

844
39:13.010 --> 39:14.030
you're on a stretcher,

845
39:14.030 --> 39:15.760
why are you wearing new shoes?

846
39:18.010 --> 39:21.260
This is called "New shoes for a new road."

847
39:21.740 --> 39:25.420
I seek for spring by riverside on a fine day.

848
39:25.740 --> 39:29.490
O what refreshing sight does the boundless view bring?

849
39:29.780 --> 39:32.490
I find the face of vernal wind in easy way:

850
39:32.740 --> 39:36.020
Myriads of reds and violets reveal only spring.

851
39:44.420 --> 39:44.950
Let's go.

852
39:45.480 --> 39:46.020
Let's go.

853
39:49.160 --> 39:49.850
Let's go.

854
39:58.930 --> 40:00.500
[Li Fuchun, Acting Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army; Chen Yun, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

855
40:06.200 --> 40:08.220
[Kaifeng (He Kefan), Alternate Member of the CPC Politburo and CPC Representative to the 9th Red Army Corps]

856
40:07.320 --> 40:08.380
Comrade Rongzhen.

857
40:08.810 --> 40:10.080
Give it another careful thought.

858
40:09.730 --> 40:11.960
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

859
40:10.340 --> 40:12.420
Does what I just said make sense?

860
40:18.030 --> 40:19.490
Political Commissar Nie.

861
40:23.090 --> 40:24.730
Kaifeng talked to you as well?

862
40:24.340 --> 40:26.630
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

863
40:25.950 --> 40:27.180
He knows it's useless to talk to me.

864
40:27.180 --> 40:28.310
It's a waste of time.

865
40:29.010 --> 40:29.940
Comrade Bo Gu.

866
40:30.090 --> 40:31.010
How did it go?

867
40:31.330 --> 40:33.690
That Nie Rongzhen is extremely stubborn.

868
40:39.530 --> 40:40.460
Comrade Li De.

869
40:44.700 --> 40:46.420
This is what I've been waiting for all day.

870
40:46.420 --> 40:47.420
Comrade Li De.

871
40:47.440 --> 40:50.890
You should trust Comrade Bo Gu

872
40:50.920 --> 40:55.200
and give him the same support he's given you.

873
40:56.480 --> 41:00.400
It seems I have no other choice.

874
41:01.780 --> 41:02.470
Let's go.

875
41:23.130 --> 41:24.130
Comrade Lin Biao.

876
41:25.090 --> 41:26.020
Comrade Shaoqi.

877
41:26.130 --> 41:26.990
Comrade Enlai.

878
41:28.450 --> 41:29.700
Comrade Shangkun.

879
41:29.810 --> 41:30.940
Vice Chairman Zhou.

880
41:31.250 --> 41:31.740
Comrade Zhuoran.

881
41:31.740 --> 41:32.870
Vice Chairman Zhou.

882
41:33.170 --> 41:33.610
Comrade Kaifeng.

883
41:33.610 --> 41:34.470
Comrade Enlai.

884
41:34.860 --> 41:35.940
-Vice Chairman Zhou. -Comrade Peng Dehuai.

885
41:35.940 --> 41:36.570
Comrade Kaifeng.

886
41:36.570 --> 41:38.570
You must be tired after the journey.

887
41:47.450 --> 41:48.780
-Chairman. -Chairman.

888
41:48.800 --> 41:50.280
-Chairman. -Chairman.

889
41:59.270 --> 42:00.270
Comrade Shaoqi.

890
42:02.780 --> 42:04.100
What a grand mansion.

891
42:04.830 --> 42:08.110
This was the home of Bai Huizhang, commander of the 2nd Guizhou Army's Division.

892
42:08.110 --> 42:09.420
His family ran a sauce shop.

893
42:09.420 --> 42:11.400
After making their fortune, they built this mansion.

894
42:11.240 --> 42:13.000
[Peng Dehuai, Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

895
42:11.610 --> 42:13.610
But before he could even live in it,

896
42:13.090 --> 42:14.510
[Liu Shaoqi, Alternate Member of the CPC Politburo and CPC Representative to the 8th Red Army Corps]

897
42:13.610 --> 42:14.940
it became our headquarters.

898
42:14.940 --> 42:16.070
So this Bai Huizhang

899
42:16.820 --> 42:20.350
comes from a sauce-making family too? (Pun: a sauce-making family sounds like a military family in Chinese)

900
42:20.350 --> 42:22.010
Comrades, the meeting room is on the second floor.

901
42:22.010 --> 42:23.070
Let's go upstairs.

902
42:23.260 --> 42:23.940
Okay.

903
42:24.570 --> 42:25.030
Chairman.

904
42:25.030 --> 42:25.900
Watch your step.

905
42:25.900 --> 42:26.860
Let's go.

906
42:28.790 --> 42:29.630
Okay.
